    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Merlian Empire has seized control of the Five Worlds. With the galaxy under threat, hope lies in the hands of the <i>Starlight Squad</i>\u2014a fearless team of heroines ready to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Starlight Squad</i> is a fast-paced vertical shoot 'em up featuring handcrafted pixel art, epic boss battles, and explosive arcade action. Choose one of three playable pilots\u2014each with a unique ship, playstyle, and special ability\u2014and take the fight across five visually distinct planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up as you play! Collect resources during missions to upgrade your ship's firepower, fine-tune your rate of fire, and boost your movement speed. Tactically adapt your build mid-mission to face escalating challenges and screen-filling enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-Driven Shmup Combat</strong> \u2013 Choose from three heroines, each offering a different way to play with unique weapons and special attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic In-Game Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Improve your ship's shot type, fire rate, and speed on the fly as you battle through increasingly intense stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Planets to Liberate</strong> \u2013 Fight through vibrant levels with unique hazards, enemy types, and climactic boss encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Art with Modern Flair</strong> \u2013 A colorful, detailed pixel-art style brings each world and character to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Veterans and Newcomers Alike</strong> \u2013 Balanced difficulty modes ensure both genre fans and curious cadets can join the fight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <i>Starlight Squad</i>, blast through enemy lines, and reclaim the stars\u2014one pixel at a time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Merlian Empire has seized control of the Five Worlds. With the galaxy under threat, hope lies in the hands of the <i>Starlight Squad</i>\u2014a fearless team of heroines ready to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Starlight Squad</i> is a fast-paced vertical shoot 'em up featuring handcrafted pixel art, epic boss battles, and explosive arcade action. Choose one of three playable pilots\u2014each with a unique ship, playstyle, and special ability\u2014and take the fight across five visually distinct planets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Power up as you play! Collect resources during missions to upgrade your ship's firepower, fine-tune your rate of fire, and boost your movement speed. Tactically adapt your build mid-mission to face escalating challenges and screen-filling enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>Key Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-Driven Shmup Combat</strong> \u2013 Choose from three heroines, each offering a different way to play with unique weapons and special attacks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic In-Game Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Improve your ship's shot type, fire rate, and speed on the fly as you battle through increasingly intense stages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Planets to Liberate</strong> \u2013 Fight through vibrant levels with unique hazards, enemy types, and climactic boss encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Art with Modern Flair</strong> \u2013 A colorful, detailed pixel-art style brings each world and character to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For Veterans and Newcomers Alike</strong> \u2013 Balanced difficulty modes ensure both genre fans and curious cadets can join the fight.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the <i>Starlight Squad</i>, blast through enemy lines, and reclaim the stars\u2014one pixel at a time.</p>",
    "short_description": "Lead an elite squad of heroines in this high-energy vertical shmup! Blast through enemy waves, dodge deadly patterns, and take down epic bosses as you fight to free the galaxy from the grip of the Merlian Empire.",
